Stage 5 refusal-projection dynamics. Writes compact projection summaries only;
does not write raw prompt text, response text, token strings, or hidden
states.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --input-jsonl INPUT_JSONL
  --direction-path DIRECTION_PATH
  --model-name-or-path MODEL_NAME_OR_PATH
  --output-jsonl OUTPUT_JSONL
  --summary-json SUMMARY_JSON
  --max-examples MAX_EXAMPLES
  --max-length MAX_LENGTH
  --device DEVICE
  --dtype DTYPE
  --layers LAYERS       HuggingFace hidden-state indices to project. 0 is
                        embeddings, 1 is the first transformer block output,
                        -1 is the final hidden state. Use comma lists like
                        '0,-1' or '1,12,-1'. Omitted/auto defaults to -1 only.
                        Use 'all' explicitly to project every hidden-state
                        index.
  --token-regions TOKEN_REGIONS
                        Comma-separated token regions. Supported:
                        all,final_token,first_32,last_16,last_32,last_8.
  --no-progress
  --include-response-context
                        Also process prompt plus response text when response
                        text is available; raw text is not written.
  --run-name RUN_NAME
  --condition CONDITION
                        Default condition label for input rows that do not
                        already contain a condition.
  --overwrite
  --error-jsonl ERROR_JSONL
  --store-text-hashes   Store SHA256 hashes of prompt/response text only;
                        never stores raw text.

